"char_end": 318,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s01"
},
{
"start": 13.67,
"end": 17.02,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Linear is the issue tracker designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 319,
"char_end": 391,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 17.02,
"end": 18.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 392,
"char_end": 413,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 18.0,
"end": 24.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we get into the details, Marco Bellini was a guest on the show and mentioned that drainage is the design choice with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 414,
"char_end": 557,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 24.0,
"end": 25.74,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Yes, that's correct.",
"char_start": 572,
"char_end": 592,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 25.74,
"end": 30.0,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "And that connects to what we're discussing today.",
"char_start": 593,
"char_end": 642,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 30.0,
"end": 36.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to point out something – Marco Bellini mentioned the same issue a couple of episodes ago.",
"char_start": 659,
"char_end": 755,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 36.0,
"end": 38.5,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Can you give me a specific example?",
"char_start": 756,
"char_end": 791,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 38.5,
"end": 42.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 792,
"char_end": 841,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 42.0,
"end": 44.71,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 856,
"char_end": 948,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 44.71,
"end": 45.97,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 949,
"char_end": 992,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 45.97,
"end": 48.0,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 993,
"char_end": 1062,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 48.0,
"end": 50.39,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into this.",
"char_start": 1079,
"char_end": 1112,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 50.39,
"end": 54.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1113,
"char_end": 1163,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 54.0,
"end": 54.31,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1178,
"char_end": 1188,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 54.31,
"end": 57.55,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than minor adjustments to the suspension.",
"char_start": 1189,
"char_end": 1292,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 57.55,
"end": 60.0,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The framing is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1293,
"char_end": 1371,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 60.0,
"end": 61.89,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Let's start from there.",
"char_start": 1388,
"char_end": 1411,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 61.89,
"end": 66.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1412,
"char_end": 1462,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 66.0,
"end": 68.88,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes – it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1477,
"char_end": 1593,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 68.88,
"end": 69.92,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1594,
"char_end": 1636,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 69.92,
"end": 72.0,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "If you ignore it, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1637,
"char_end": 1721,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 72.0,
"end": 78.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 1738,
"char_end": 1765,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 78.0,
"end": 81.25,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this becomes particularly clear.",
"char_start": 1780,
"char_end": 1864,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 81.25,
"end": 84.0,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1865,
"char_end": 1936,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 84.0,
"end": 87.35,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
"char_start": 1953,
"char_end": 2011,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 87.35,
"end": 90.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 2012,
"char_end": 2058,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 90.0,
"end": 90.56,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2073,
"char_end": 2093,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 90.56,
"end": 94.11,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the race track sections change the choice of trajectory between practice runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 2094,
"char_end": 2220,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 94.11,
"end": 96.0,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 2221,
"char_end": 2288,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 96.0,
"end": 100.31,
