"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 5262,
"char_end": 5313,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 223.15,
"end": 225.51,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 5314,
"char_end": 5419,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 225.51,
"end": 226.61,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5420,
"char_end": 5469,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 226.61,
"end": 228.0,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5470,
"char_end": 5532,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s04"
},
{
"start": 228.0,
"end": 234.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Come back.",
"char_start": 5549,
"char_end": 5559,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 234.0,
"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the trade-off becomes apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5574,
"char_end": 5727,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 240.0,
"end": 243.19,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
"char_start": 5744,
"char_end": 5802,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 243.19,
"end": 246.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the most important aspect of this question?",
"char_start": 5803,
"char_end": 5854,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 246.0,
"end": 246.55,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 5869,
"char_end": 5889,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 246.55,
"end": 250.1,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the race track sections influence the choice of trajectory between practice runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 5890,
"char_end": 6019,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 250.1,
"end": 252.0,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 6020,
"char_end": 6089,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s03"
},
{
"start": 252.0,
"end": 258.0,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6106,
"char_end": 6174,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 258.0,
"end": 262.26,
